  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "c2aeb031-feb4-4b05-9e5d-b059b7451bc6",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# 05 Pole a Kolekce\n**autor: Erik Kr\u00E1l ekral@utb.cz**\n\n---\n\nPro zvl\u00E1dnut\u00ED p\u0159edm\u011Btu pot\u0159ebujete v\u011Bd\u011Bt jak definovat pole, inicializovat ho, p\u0159istupovat k jeho prvk\u016Fm, vytv\u00E1\u0159et kopii pole a porovn\u00E1vat hodnoty v poli."
    },
    {
      "id": "80dba7e8-098a-407a-8042-0bf2633d64d6",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Jednorozm\u011Brn\u00E1 pole"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1925e65-2881-46cb-aa3e-77a25d9b4ee0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Typ pole vytvo\u0159\u00EDme tak, \u017Ee za typ prvk\u016F v poli p\u0159id\u00E1me \u0060[]\u0060, nap\u0159\u00EDklad pole cel\u00FDch \u010D\u00EDsel \u0060int\u0060 zap\u00ED\u0161eme jako \u0060int[]\u0060. N\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDkaz definuje prom\u011Bnnou typu pole \u0060int[]\u0060 a proto\u017Ee pole je referen\u010Dn\u00ED typ, tak mu m\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159i\u0159adit hodnotu \u0060null\u0060 co\u017E znamen\u00E1 \u017Ee, nem\u00E1 je\u0161t\u011B p\u0159i\u0159azen\u00E9 \u017E\u00E1dn\u00E9 hodnoty.\n\nPole m\u00E1 pevn\u00FD po\u010Det prvk\u016F, nem\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159id\u00E1vat nebo odeb\u00EDrat prvky po tom co jej vytvo\u0159\u00EDme.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "faae2824-cde3-4b67-8f34-fa1b8290f4a1",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[]? pole = null;",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "11ffa48b-0a1e-4b86-a5a4-400ee92c9fd2",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "pole",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u0026lt;null\u0026gt;\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fe6ccad3-9653-48a8-a46f-a925c0cad28b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pam\u011B\u0165 pro vlastn\u00ED hodnoty prvk\u016F potom alokujeme pomoc\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDkazu \u0060new int[3]\u0060 kdy hodnota \u00603\u0060 je po\u010Det prvk\u016F. Prom\u011Bnn\u00E1 pole potom p\u0159edstavuje referenci na z\u00E1sobn\u00EDku na data alokovan\u00E9 na hald\u011B (pojmy z\u00E1sobn\u00EDk a halda probereme v p\u0159edn\u00E1\u0161ce [Zasobnik_halda_reference](https://github.com/ekral/FAI/tree/master/PA/Zasobnik_halda_reference)."
    },
    {
      "id": "99a0e916-a6c3-4bcc-a8a6-ce6889d166fe",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "pole = new int[3];"
    },
    {
      "id": "77c8bc00-87dc-467f-a913-49eb718772e7",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Oba p\u0159\u00EDkazy m\u016F\u017Eeme slou\u010Dit do jednoho z\u00E1pisu:"
    },
    {
      "id": "98b4c44d-ccbb-4958-b45c-60950c41d0ff",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = new int[3];"
    },
    {
      "id": "b6ae0130-904d-4622-8699-ed8b2a0ab67d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "a hodnoty m\u016F\u017Eeme inicializovat pole pomoc\u00ED z\u00E1pisu \u0060{1,2,3}\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "e523f549-589f-4eb5-9bc6-2603f938574f",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = new int[3] { 1, 2, 3 };",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1f5a04a-21ba-4fd8-86fd-1740939dd510",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "nebo zjednodu\u0161en\u011B pomoc\u00ED  \u0060[1, 2, 3]\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b8a816f-04ce-494a-be56-04a4c1c441b4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = [1, 2, 3];",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "365c857a-c99a-4e93-b05d-821954036cee",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "P\u0159edchoz\u00ED z\u00E1pis m\u016F\u017Eeme zapsat r\u016Fzn\u00FDmi zp\u016Fsoby. V\u0161echny n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED z\u00E1pisy maj\u00ED stejn\u00FD v\u00FDsledek:"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e4d1e3a-aa57-4f2a-b2ab-ff65b953b6f4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole1 = new int[3] { 1, 2, 3 };\nint[] pole2 = new int[] { 1, 2, 3 };\nint[] pole3 = new [] { 1, 2, 3 };\nint[] pole4 = { 1, 2, 3 };\nint[] pole5 = [1, 2, 3]; // od .NET 8"
    },
    {
      "id": "009ec683-c87e-47e7-ac1d-ded48090166c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Nov\u00FD z\u00E1pis pomoc\u00ED hranat\u00FDch z\u00E1vorek je nejuniverz\u00E1ln\u011Bj\u0161\u00ED a m\u016F\u017Eeme pou\u017E\u00EDt i pro do\u010Dasn\u00FD objekt, kter\u00FD p\u0159ed\u00E1v\u00E1me jako argument metod\u011B."
    },
    {
      "id": "2d8b21a1-276d-423c-9d8c-36a0e53cc41b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "void Vypis(int[] pole)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0027,\u0027, pole));\n}\n\nVypis([1, 2, 7, 3, 9]);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1,2,7,3,9\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e694d1bb-0cfb-41b9-938d-0f6f5ff198d9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Hodnoty prvk\u016F poli m\u016F\u017Eeme vypsat na konzoli s vyu\u017Eit\u00EDm p\u0159\u00EDkazu \u0060string.Join\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ec1ed5f-8aea-4310-913f-2aebf8678eac",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Console.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole));",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1,2,3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1478757-cb50-4fa3-8a79-ff5178ba3fa0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "K jednotliv\u00FDm prvk\u016F poli p\u0159istupujeme pomoc\u00ED hranat\u00FDch z\u00E1vorek \u0060[]\u0060, kdy index za\u010D\u00EDn\u00E1 od nuly:"
    },
    {
      "id": "9af4cc90-962c-4a14-b9ce-85bcf7678730",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = [1, 2, 3 ];\nConsole.WriteLine(pole[0]); // prvni prvek\nConsole.WriteLine(pole[1]); // druhy prvek\nConsole.WriteLine(pole[2]); // treti prvek",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1\n2\n3\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4137161d-517d-4f84-9007-38200e52b141",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Delku pole zjist\u00EDme pomoc\u00ED property \u0060pole.Length\u0060. N\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDkaz nastav\u00ED hodnoty pole na 0,1,2:"
    },
    {
      "id": "9961dad7-25c0-4556-9238-cb91e2a297ee",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = new int[3];\n\nfor (int i = 0; i \u003C pole.Length; i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    pole[i] = i;\n}\n\npole.Length",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E3\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "df012c46-389f-4776-bfdc-f84bab70b038",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud p\u0159i\u0159ad\u00EDme hodnotu pole jin\u00E9mu poli tak p\u0159ed\u00E1me referenci na stejn\u00E9 prvky v poli. V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm p\u0159\u00EDkazu tedy pole1 i pole2 maj\u00ED referenci na stejn\u00E1 data:"
    },
    {
      "id": "9ae1915f-93fb-494d-a463-e0b9d891c5ca",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole1 = [1, 2, 3];\nint[] pole2 = pole1;\n\npole2[1] = 0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole1));\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole2));\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1,0,3\n1,0,3\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f32e7b16-fb12-4ba0-9ccf-45a7b50b3a34",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud chceme vytvorit nezavisle kopie, tak mame nekolik moznosti:"
    },
    {
      "id": "1fd04cd0-2294-4fe1-aac1-c0ccad60a8c4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] original = [1, 2, 3 ];\n\nint[] kopie1 = original.ToArray(); // vyzaduje using System.Linq\n\nint[] kopie2 = new int[original.Length];\noriginal.CopyTo(kopie2, 0);\n\nint[] kopie3 = new int[original.Length];\nArray.Copy(original, kopie3, original.Length);\n\noriginal[1] = 0;\n// vsechny kopie maji sva data a jsou nezavisle na originalnim poli\n\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, original));\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, kopie1));\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, kopie2));\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, kopie3));",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1,0,3\n1,2,3\n1,2,3\n1,2,3\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2a3e42a8-c405-4574-9ec9-de78dbb976f0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Cyklus foreach\n\nCyklus \u0060foreach\u0060 provede p\u0159\u00EDkaz nebo blok p\u0159\u00EDkaz\u016F pro ka\u017Ed\u00FD prvek z typu, kter\u00FD podporuje rozhran\u00ED \u0060IEnumberable\u0060. Kdy v\u0161echny typy, kter\u00E9 v tomto notebooku prob\u00EDr\u00E1me jej podporuj\u00ED.\n\nN\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDkaz projde v\u0161echna \u010D\u00EDsla v poli \u0060cisla\u0060 a vyp\u00ED\u0161e je na termin\u00E1l."
    },
    {
      "id": "6c767788-99fc-47c7-80c2-a29e368d18ad",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] cisla = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];\n\nforeach(int cislo in cisla)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(cislo);\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "13fedb25-3a32-4a6e-a482-66d2e53c9e79",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "V cyklu foreach nem\u016F\u017Eeme m\u011Bnit hodnotu itera\u010Dn\u00ED prom\u011Bnn\u00E9."
    },
    {
      "id": "9e461930-9eed-4383-9278-141863da933b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] cisla = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];\n\nforeach(int cislo in cisla)\n{\n    cislo = 0; // Chyba: nelze menit hodnotu promenne v foreach\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe9dbcbf-6a8f-432d-9ce6-7e26f0b51bdd",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "##\tMultidimensional array a Jagged array\n\nU vice rozm\u011Brn\u00FDch pol\u00ED m\u00E1me dv\u011B mo\u017Enosti [Multidimensional array](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/programming-guide/arrays/multidimensional-arrays) a [Jagged array](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/programming-guide/arrays/jagged-arrays)."
    },
    {
      "id": "2f73156d-40c3-4bb6-8a23-54dba14120ab",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Multidimensional array se definuje n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm zp\u016Fsobem kdy v tomto p\u0159\u00EDkladu \u0159\u00EDk\u00E1me, \u017Ee chceme m\u00EDt dv\u011B pole o t\u0159ech prvc\u00EDch. Prakticky jde o jednorozm\u011Brn\u00E9 pole, kter\u00E9 indexujeme jako v\u00EDcerozm\u011Brn\u00E9."
    },
    {
      "id": "3595ff61-0407-44f7-ab5a-0b0475812f1b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[,] multidimensionalArray = new int[2, 3]\n{\n    { 1, 2, 3 },\n    { 4, 5, 6 }\n};",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2bf75063-2fa3-4b01-b534-3e5839cd6e1d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Property \u0060Length\u0060 by n\u00E1m vr\u00E1tila celkov\u00FD po\u010Det prvk\u016F, tedy 2 x 3 = 6 prvk\u016F."
    },
    {
      "id": "949b1bd3-7a2e-439c-83ae-e6936d9b58ba",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "multidimensionalArray.Length",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E6\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a626bb1b-fb57-4469-af2f-e68850de3add",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Vr\u00E1t\u00ED prvek s indexem 1,2, kte\u0159\u00FD p\u0159epo\u010D\u00EDt\u00E1 na jednorozm\u011Brn\u00E9 pole 1 * 3 \u002B 2."
    },
    {
      "id": "fdc22bb5-3d84-457d-9b3e-d30a9b078ea6",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "multidimensionalArray[1,2]",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E6\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5acc67ca-549e-40b3-a4c1-eeb4cb1e79ad",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Rozm\u011Bry multidimensional array z\u00EDsk\u00E1me pomoc\u00ED metody \u0060GetLength\u0060, kdy argumentem je index dimenze. V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm p\u0159\u00EDpad\u011B \u0060GetLength(0)\u0060 vr\u00E1t\u00ED hodnotu 2 a \u0060GetLength(1)\u0060 vr\u00E1t\u00ED hodnotu \u00603\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "259c79bf-4ccd-4fac-82e2-15e8812ea8d7",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "for (int i = 0; i \u003C multidimensionalArray.GetLength(0); i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    for (int j = 0; j \u003C multidimensionalArray.GetLength(1); j\u002B\u002B)\n    {\n        int prvek = multidimensionalArray[i, j];\n        Console.Write($\u0022{prvek} \u0022);\n    }\n\n    Console.WriteLine();\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1 2 3 \n4 5 6 \n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b129f50b-f38f-4a0e-a5a8-ecbfd0b5fb25",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Oproti tomu Jagged array p\u0159edstavuje pole referenc\u00ED na dal\u0161\u00ED pole, kter\u00E1 pak mus\u00EDme inicializovat zvl\u00E1\u0161\u0165. Ka\u017Ed\u00FD \u0159\u00E1dek potom m\u016F\u017Ee m\u00EDt r\u016Fzn\u00FD po\u010Det prvk\u016F. "
    },
    {
      "id": "0e5acdf2-957e-40c4-9773-5f6acc26e556",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Nejprve si nadefinujeme pole referenc\u00ED:"
    },
    {
      "id": "a708f15e-ce2b-4329-9688-b3caf88a6050",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[][] jaggedArray = new int[2][];",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bcdaca28-e911-4d83-bb69-f931e1d75aa2",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "A potom alokujeme pam\u011B\u0165 pro jednotliv\u00E9 \u0159\u00E1dky, tedy jednorozm\u011Brn\u00E9 pole:"
    },
    {
      "id": "a90f2de2-32b5-4b36-b006-647ccb5599bb",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "jaggedArray[0] = new int[] { 1, 2, 3 };\njaggedArray[1] = new int[] { 4, 5 };",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bcbd2568-2244-4dc9-b38d-cd3b01e4881b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Potom proch\u00E1z\u00EDme jednotliv\u00E9 \u0159\u00E1dky ka\u017Ed\u00FD \u0159\u00E1dek proch\u00E1z\u00EDme jako jednorozm\u011Brn\u00E9 pole:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3579cc9-e507-41a8-be3f-7a6987ec6b5b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "for (int i = 0; i \u003C jaggedArray.Length; i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    int[] radek = jaggedArray[i];\n\n    for (int j = 0; j \u003C radek.Length; j\u002B\u002B)\n    {\n        int prvek = radek[j];\n        Console.Write($\u0022{prvek} \u0022);\n    }\n\n    Console.WriteLine();\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1 2 3 \n4 5 \n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5b5b021a-121e-4d50-bbe4-1cb71e43fa12",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Jagged array je rychlej\u0161\u00ED pro sekven\u010Dn\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDstup k prvk\u016Fm ne\u017E Multidimensional array, proto\u017Ee prakticky po z\u00EDsk\u00E1n\u00ED refence na \u0159\u00E1dek m\u016F\u017Eeme proch\u00E1zet jednorozm\u011Brn\u00E9 pole prvek po prvku."
    },
    {
      "id": "d09f2681-bea0-455d-b0b9-90aa083f288e",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Kolekce"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b740434-d2cf-45eb-82ce-fb6e76f0d19a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Posledn\u00ED dva typy, kter\u00E9 probereme je dynamick\u00E9 pole \u0060List\u0060 a asociativn\u00ED pole \u0060Dictionary\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "806c7e56-6c01-4b53-a636-9143e607aa8e",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### List\n\nGenerick\u00E1 t\u0159\u00EDda \u0060List\u003Cint\u003E\u0060 p\u0159edstavuje dynamick\u00E9 pole, tedy pole do kter\u00E9ho m\u016F\u017Ee-me p\u0159id\u00E1vat nov\u00E9 prvky a tak\u00E9 prvky odeb\u00EDrat. Jde o nej\u010Dast\u011Bji pou\u017E\u00EDvan\u00FD typ kolekc\u00ED."
    },
    {
      "id": "47d14495-9288-4801-b658-e27ec1666829",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Instanci t\u0159\u00EDdy \u0060List\u003CT\u003E\u0060 nadefinujeme n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm zp\u016Fsobem:"
    },
    {
      "id": "e54ac2e4-001d-44f3-ad1e-32534a6e2b9d",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "List\u003Cint\u003E listCisel = new List\u003Cint\u003E { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 };",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "10683c11-e01f-46bb-acf4-c28460e3262c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Po\u010Det prvk\u016F zjist\u00EDme, na rozd\u00EDl od pole, pomoc\u00ED property \u0060Count\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "507d7753-fa99-47c9-90c4-bdb3c5921dd4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int pocetPrvku = listCisel.Count;\n\npocetPrvku",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E6\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "76ee6f0d-034c-4f24-a2e4-e6d6ab959aa1",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pro p\u0159\u00EDstup k prvk\u016Fm m\u016F\u017Eeme op\u011Bt pou\u017E\u00EDt oper\u00E1tor indexace []."
    },
    {
      "id": "d319b462-52e9-415b-82e5-991d4d9637dd",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "for (int i = 0; i \u003C pocetPrvku; i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    int prvek = listCisel[i];\n    Console.WriteLine(prvek);\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 34
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dc3471b2-53d3-4ebd-a2ed-a240679c7889",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud chceme proj\u00EDt v\u0161echny prvky, tak nej\u010Dast\u011Bj\u0161i pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1me p\u0159\u00EDkaz \u0060foreach\u0060, kter\u00FD projde v\u0161echny prvky."
    },
    {
      "id": "86d8d329-b9b9-47fc-b088-2b5c7e7efd5e",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "foreach (int prvek in listCisel)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(prvek);\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 35
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8e5a750b-5594-4ead-8db8-1a2f607ff6ef",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Do dynamick\u00E9ho pole m\u016F\u017Eeme prvky p\u0159idat jak na konec tak na libovoln\u00FD index.\n\nPokud p\u0159id\u00E1v\u00E1me nakonec, tak jde o rychlou operaci, pokud n\u00E1m ale nedojde pam\u011B\u0165. Pokud dojde, tak si List p\u0159ialokuje typicky pam\u011Bt pro dvakr\u00E1t tolik prvk\u016F kolik obsahuje.\n\nPokud vkl\u00E1d\u00E1me prvky na za\u010D\u00E1tek nebo doprost\u0159ed, tak mus\u00ED posunout v\u0161echny ostatn\u00ED prvky doprava. N\u00E1ro\u010Dnost operace tedy roste line\u00E1rn\u011B s po\u010Dtem prvk\u016F."
    },
    {
      "id": "d871b50f-088e-4207-b1ba-6ad657d880ac",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "listCisel.Add(4); // pridam na konec\nlistCisel.Insert(0, 6); // vlozim na zacatek\nlistCisel.Insert(2, 7); // vlozim na index 2\n\nlistCisel",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E[ 6, 1, 7, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 4 ]\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "efff2443-e51e-4efd-b340-e169e2e0972e",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Tak\u00E9 m\u016F\u017Eeme odstranit prvek s ur\u010Ditou hodnotou, nebo odebrat prvek z ur\u010Dit\u00E9ho idnexu."
    },
    {
      "id": "5ce2585c-1bff-4e37-944b-8b1e903abcc6",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "listCisel.Remove(7);    // odstrani prvek s hodnotou 7\nlistCisel.RemoveAt(0);  // odstrani prvek s indexem",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 38
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "31416048-4097-4f93-a2e7-59f7c1f466ca",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Tak\u00E9 m\u016F\u017Eeme odstranit v\u0161echny prvky v poli pomoc\u00ED metody Clear."
    },
    {
      "id": "80dcec81-4811-42d5-8c09-689357d16172",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "listCisel.Clear();\n\nlistCisel",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E[  ]\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
