    {
      "id": "6114c1e3-1077-44a1-b316-2abe4f0029fa",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Nov\u00E9 studenty potom m\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159id\u00E1vat s pomoc\u00ED metody \u0060Add\u0060."
    },
    {
