    },
    {
      "id": "99d76a6c-20df-4257-82b1-076bfeea5e9d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud by student s dan\u00FDm z\u00E1znamem u\u017E v kolekci existoval, tak program vyvol\u00E1 v\u00FDjimku. Proto je vhodn\u011Bj\u0161\u00ED p\u0159edem ov\u011B\u0159it, zda dan\u00FD kl\u00ED\u010D u\u017E existuje. A to bu\u010F star\u0161\u00EDm zp\u016Fsobem:"
    },
    {
      "id": "78da7d5e-9d2c-41e2-b8a7-864557c6a48c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "if (!studenti.ContainsKey(129))\n{\n    studenti.Add(129, \u0022Jana\u0022);\n}\n\nstudenti",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
