      "id": "badfe0ea-0f8e-4d60-846b-30209019f576",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Queue\n\nQueque p\u0159edstavuje kolekci ze kter\u00E9 vykl\u00E1d\u00E1me prvky ve stejn\u00E9m po\u0159ad\u00ED v jak\u00E9m je vkl\u00E1d\u00E1me. Prvn\u00ED vlo\u017Een\u00FD prvek tedy jako prvn\u00ED vylo\u017E\u00EDme."
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69ca25-965c-4c0d-953b-392f8db87b91",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Queue\u003Cint\u003E fronta = new Queue\u003Cint\u003E();\n\nfronta.Enqueue(1);\nfronta.Enqueue(2);  \nfronta.Enqueue(3);\n\nint prvek = fronta.Dequeue(); // 1\n\nprvek",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E1\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a7dc824f-3e55-475b-83c9-d4705dead5b3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Stack\n\nStack p\u0159edstavuje kolekci ze kter\u00E9 vykl\u00E1d\u00E1me prvky ve opa\u010Dn\u00E9m po\u0159ad\u00ED v jak\u00E9m je vkl\u00E1d\u00E1me. Posledn\u011B vlo\u017Een\u00FD prvek tedy jako prvn\u00ED vylo\u017E\u00EDme."
    },
    {
      "id": "2847ae23-04c2-4a7d-a188-e83cbf1cd23a",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Stack\u003Cint\u003E zasobnik = new Stack\u003Cint\u003E();\n\nzasobnik.Push(1);\nzasobnik.Push(2);\nzasobnik.Push(3);\n\nint prvek = zasobnik.Pop(); // 3\n\nprvek",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E3\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
