    {
      "id": "65d73bec-3a5a-49aa-a09f-ce6180b64c8c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "---\n## P\u0159\u00EDklady k procvi\u010Dov\u00E1n\u00ED"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d68c54d-d6c9-45f9-acf9-6f614f95e85a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 1: Suma prvk\u016F v poli"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b47e0f8-1320-4852-baf7-26a120d2f345",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = { 5, 7, 1, 2, 3 };\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole));\n\n// pomoc\u00ED cyklu for spo\u010D\u00EDtejte a vypi\u0161te sumu prvk\u016F v poli\n\n// alternativn\u011B pou\u017Eijte LINQ metodu"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7b7bdcd-248b-41b0-8c4c-e5860f72144a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 2: Opa\u010Den\u00E9 po\u0159ad\u00ED prvk\u016F v poli"
    },
    {
      "id": "215e8915-6181-4d21-9362-31445a9096ef",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = { 1, 2, 7, 5, 6, 3, 8 };\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole));\n\n// pomoci cyklu for zmente poradi prvku pole aby byly pozpatku\n// prvky budou v poradi 8,3,6,5,7,2,1\n\n// Alternativn\u011B m\u016F\u017Eu pou\u017E\u00EDjte LINQ metodu"
    },
    {
      "id": "60835abb-7ff8-4422-9c0c-89200418b123",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 3: Pr\u016Fm\u011Brn\u00FD v\u00FDsledek studenta\n\nZ konzole zad\u00E1vejte v\u00FDsledek testu studenta dokud u\u017Eivatel nenap\u00ED\u0161e slovo \u0022konec\u0022. Pot\u00E9 vypi\u0161te pr\u016Fm\u011Br z test\u016F a v\u00FDsledek, kter\u00FD je tomuto pr\u016Fm\u011Bru nejbl\u00ED\u017Ee."
    },
    {
      "id": "a532f155-779e-4eac-aebb-b31807614738",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED 4: Histogram znak\u016F v textu\n\nPomoc\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDkazu \u0060System.IO.File.ReadAllText\u0060 nebo pomoc\u00ED t\u0159\u00EDdy \u0060StreamReader\u0060 na\u010Dt\u011Bte textov\u00FD soubor a vytvo\u0159te histogram v\u00FDskytu znak\u016F v textu. Pro ka\u017Ed\u00FD znak vyskytuj\u00EDc\u00ED se v textu spo\u010D\u00EDtejte kolikr\u00E1t se v textu vyskytuje. V\u00FDhodou \u0060StreamReader\u0060 je, \u017Ee nena\u010D\u00EDt\u00E1me cel\u00FD soubor do pam\u011Bti."
    },
    {
      "id": "6fc53ea1-dd31-4029-a602-1349383e67ce",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "string text = System.IO.File.ReadAllText(\u0022text.txt\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "3abd58a7-3cc6-4ef5-a38e-4324f094e7ee",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "using System.IO;\n\nusing(StreamReader reader = new StreamReader(\u0022text.txt\u0022))\n{\n\n    int znak;\n    while((znak = reader.Read()) != -1)\n    {\n        Console.Write((char)znak);\n    }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c558c92-48a7-48e1-b34b-e0d6b99e7b0a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "---\n## \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDklad\u016F k procvi\u010Dov\u00E1n\u00ED"
    },
    {
      "id": "935eaf01-64ed-4dc1-87a0-d3571f9e7870",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 1: Suma prvk\u016F v poli"
    },
    {
      "id": "6af8ff08-b5a9-4b3b-b5d4-f51c94cc16d7",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = { 5, 7, 1, 2, 3 };\n\n// pomoc\u00ED cyklu forspo\u010D\u00EDtejte a vypi\u0161te sumu prvk\u016F v poli\n\nint suma = 0;\nforeach (int prvek in pole)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(prvek);\n    suma \u002B= prvek;\n}\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022soucet prvku v poli je {suma}\u0022);\n\n// alternativn\u011B pou\u017Eijte LINQ metodu\n\nsuma = pole.Sum();"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1a57e3e-9c2d-4783-a905-701d1cbf06d8",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 2: Opa\u010Dn\u00E9 po\u0159ad\u00ED prvk\u016F v poli"
    },
    {
      "id": "14e0386f-d17b-4887-af0e-265ac7ff48f7",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int[] pole = { 1, 2, 7, 5, 6, 3, 8 };\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole));\n\n// pomoci cyklu for zmente poradi prvku pole aby byly pozpatku\n// prvky budou v poradi 8,3,6,5,7,2,1\n\nint prvniIndex = 0;\nint posledniIndex = pole.Length - 1;\nint n = pole.Length / 2;\n\nfor (int i = 0; i \u003C n; i\u002B\u002B)\n{\n    int tmp = pole[posledniIndex];\n    pole[posledniIndex] = pole[prvniIndex];\n    pole[prvniIndex] = tmp;\n\n    \u002B\u002BprvniIndex;\n    --posledniIndex;\n}\n\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole));\n\nfor (int i = 0, j = pole.Length - 1; i \u003C pole.Length / 2; i\u002B\u002B, j--)\n{\n    int tmp = pole[j];\n    pole[j] = pole[i];\n    pole[i] = tmp;\n}\n\nConsole.WriteLine(string.Join(\u0022,\u0022, pole));\n\n// Alternativn\u011B m\u016F\u017Eu pou\u017E\u00EDjte LINQ metodu\n\npole.Reverse();"
    },
    {
      "id": "75c66968-bc65-4df0-b884-46ec3d91b162",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 3: Pr\u016Fm\u011Brn\u00FD v\u00FDsledek studenta\n\n\u0158e\u0161en\u00ED pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1 LINQ metody, kter\u00E9 jsme je\u0161t\u011B neprob\u00EDrali. Ale pro tento p\u0159\u00EDklad jsou velmi u\u017Eite\u010Dn\u00E9."
    },
    {
      "id": "a9fc549c-f373-4f9b-b1cc-7099cffa1a1b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "List\u003Cdouble\u003E cisla = [];\n\nstring? radek;\n\ndo\n{\n    // radek = Console.ReadLine(); // pouzit na konzoli\n\n    radek = await Microsoft.DotNet.Interactive.Kernel.GetInputAsync(\u0022Pick a number.\u0022); // Pouziti pouze v polyglot notebooku\n\n    if (radek == \u0022konec\u0022)\n    {\n        break;\n    }\n\n    if(double.TryParse(radek, out double cislo))\n    {\n        cisla.Add(cislo);\n    }\n\n} while (true);\n\nif(cisla.Count \u003E 0)\n{\n    double prumer = cisla.Average();\n    double nejblizsi = cisla.MinBy(x =\u003E Math.Abs(x - prumer));\n\n    Console.WriteLine($\u0022prumer: {prumer} nejblizsi: {nejblizsi}\u0022);\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "prumer: 2 nejblizsi: 2\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1a919ac7-0b36-4606-a59c-d6958dac1458",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Druh\u00E9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ED bez pou\u017Eit\u00ED LINQ"
    },
    {
      "id": "aadfeb26-1988-4e69-9cbe-523e93b7af95",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "List\u003Cdouble\u003E cisla = [];\n\ndouble suma = 0.0;\n\nstring? radek;\n\ndo\n{\n    // radek = Console.ReadLine(); // pouzit na konzoli\n\n    radek = await Microsoft.DotNet.Interactive.Kernel.GetInputAsync(\u0022Pick a number.\u0022); // Pouziti pouze v polyglot notebooku\n\n    if (radek == \u0022konec\u0022)\n    {\n        break;\n    }\n\n    if(double.TryParse(radek, out double cislo))\n    {\n        cisla.Add(cislo);\n\n        suma \u002B= cislo;\n    }\n    \n} while (true);\n\nif (cisla.Count \u003E 0)\n{\n    double prumer = suma / cisla.Count;\n\n    double nejblizsi = cisla[0];\n    double min_odchylka = Math.Abs(prumer - nejblizsi);\n\n    for (int i = 1; i \u003C cisla.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n    {\n        double cislo = cisla[i];\n\n        double odchylka = Math.Abs(prumer - cislo);\n\n        if(odchylka \u003C min_odchylka)\n        {\n            nejblizsi = cislo;\n            min_odchylka = odchylka;\n\n        }\n    }\n\n    Console.WriteLine($\u0022prumer: {prumer} nejblizsi: {nejblizsi}\u0022);\n}",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "prumer: 3.5 nejblizsi: 3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f9a5d148-91e6-4e0c-bfe4-bcec1e9f090f",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED 4: Histogram znak\u016F v textu"
    },
    {
      "id": "85740c9a-3c66-46a2-a4f0-60ec072d6f93",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "using System.IO;\n\nDictionary\u003Cint, int\u003E znaky = [];\n\nusing(StreamReader reader = new(\u0022text.txt\u0022))\n{\n\n    int znak;\n    while((znak = reader.Read()) != -1)\n    {\n        if(znaky.TryGetValue(znak, out int value))\n        {\n            znaky[znak] = \u002B\u002Bvalue;\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            znaky[znak] = 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    foreach((int key, int value) in znaky)\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine($\u0022{(char)key}: {value}\u0022);\n    }\n}"
    }
  ]
}